  '俊忠': { n: 'Toshitada', tip: ['Fujiwara no Toshitada', 'Family: Son of Fujiwara no Tadaie', 'Note: At the Horikawa-in love-letter contest of 1102, he sent Kii the poem "Hito shirenu...". Grandfather of Fujiwara no Sadaie'] },
